# Optional runtime settings for Callup. This file is preserved on upgrades.
#
# Set these paths on the host that owns your completed library:
# CALLUP_TV_LIBRARY_PATH=/data/complete/Television
# CALLUP_MOVIE_LIBRARY_PATH=/data/complete/Movies
#
# Add provider credentials here only if you deliberately want environment-based
# fallbacks. The Connections screen is the normal configuration path.
